sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Child Agent
  participant Gt as Escalation Gate
  participant R as Staff Radio Broker
  participant A as Specialist Advisors
  participant TR as Tactical Registry
  participant B as Delivery Broker
  W->>Gt: Tactical Request
  Gt->>Gt: identity/environment/skills/evidence/dedupe
  alt missing evidence
    Gt-->>W: EVIDENCE_REQUIRED
  else strategic
    Gt-->>W: ESCALATE_TO_GENERAL
  else admissible
    Gt->>R: enqueue + lease
    R->>A: wake eligible advisor
    A->>TR: retrieve 3-5 candidates
    TR-->>A: versioned procedures
    A-->>R: one compiled Directive
    R->>B: taskVersion/expiry/permission check
    B-->>W: guidance delivery
  end
